{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hana.parkoffer",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "游乐场的合作说明会",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hana.parkoffer",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hana.parkoffer",
    "idolId": "hana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "「ニュー・はなタウン」？",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。说是名字有缘，想请羽那当主题公园的形象角色，做联动。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "名字──！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "是「はなタウン」和「羽那」对吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "可是，形象角色要做什么呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "说是拍海报和广告，不用太用力。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这样啊──",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "顺便问一句，羽那去过「ニュー・はなタウン」吗──",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "没有哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "也是啊。毕竟才刚搬过来……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不过离拍摄也没多少时间了。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "园区白天才开，按行程算，去一趟很难啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "text": "说明会结束前，工作人员问还有没有别的问题。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "是。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过──其实铃木还没去过「ニュー・はなタウン」。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可是在拍主视觉之前去一趟，行程上又排不开……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "作为形象角色，这样是不是有点不合适……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "text": "对方想了想，说：那就在开园前来，虽然时间早一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "text": "游乐设施不能开动，但园内的气氛还是能感受一下的。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶……！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这也太麻烦您了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "text": "对方说，铃木是重要的合作对象，这点对应是应该的。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "text": "而且——要是平常的日子让她来，园区会乱成一团的。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，不不不……！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "text": "对方说，开园前的话不用变装，也不用在意别人的目光。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "既然人家都这么说了，那就去吧……？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "呵呵，嗯──！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没想到真的能在开园前进去啊……！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "是呀──",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……那个，那天是我和制作人一起去「はなタウン」对吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是这样……怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，没有。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "我只是觉得，那会非常期待啊──！",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "想去吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯！",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "开园前的主题公园，还是第一次──！",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。这绝对是羽那作为偶像努力才有的经历。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶──，是这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "那我就得好好享受「はなタウン」了──！",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，嗯……！不过说不定也不用那么努力，一起享受吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯──！",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "开园前的主题公园啊……总觉得有点紧张。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "──没有客人的时候，也就是说那天只有制作人和我两个人？",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，会是这样吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这样啊──好厉害──！",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "呵呵，总觉得，越来越期待了──！"
      }
    }
  },
